{"version":1,"content":"<p>互動藝術與科學學會（AIAS）宣佈，任天堂代表董事兼研究員宮本茂成為第30屆D.I.C.E. Awards新設「傳奇獎」的首位得主。該獎被定位為代表一個世代的榮譽，頒發頻率不高於每十年一次。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586760.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.801561+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:32:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_hash":"5763a1959f99516dad768e2705a3e995c78ef8ec3b7c1d70d5b5f73d77cb90c8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}